WEBVTT

01:21.440 --> 01:26.860
[A Splendid Match]

01:27.610 --> 01:29.780
[Episode 23]

01:32.680 --> 01:34.039
Here, Lord Chen.

01:36.640 --> 01:37.700
The food is not bad.

01:39.560 --> 01:41.030
No matter how dumb we are,

01:41.350 --> 01:43.009
we wouldn't dare neglect you.

01:43.150 --> 01:45.160
Regarding the disaster relief case,

01:45.160 --> 01:47.150
are there any new developments outside?

01:47.150 --> 01:47.680
Yes.

01:48.640 --> 01:50.509
All the men of
Gu Dezhao's household, the Director

01:50.509 --> 01:52.350
of the Ministry of Revenue,
have been imprisoned.

01:52.350 --> 01:53.680
His daughter cried foul

01:53.710 --> 01:56.170
and sued all the way
to Shuntian Prefecture.

01:58.590 --> 01:59.190
Thank you.

01:59.210 --> 02:00.140
You're welcome.

02:00.680 --> 02:02.640
If there's anything you want to know,

02:02.640 --> 02:04.170
just ask, so long as it won't

02:04.510 --> 02:05.570
get me implicated.

02:05.590 --> 02:06.230
Okay.

02:16.140 --> 02:19.630
[Shuntian Prefecture]

02:16.190 --> 02:17.400
My Lord,

02:18.000 --> 02:20.680
not to mention that every pass and seal
for goods coming in and out

02:20.680 --> 02:21.710
requires the senior officials'

02:21.710 --> 02:23.570
signatures and official stamps.

02:23.630 --> 02:25.710
Just to transport
a full 12,000 tons of grain,

02:25.710 --> 02:28.040
it would require hundreds of large carts.

02:28.400 --> 02:29.240
But my father is merely

02:29.240 --> 02:31.400
a Director of the Treasury
in the Ministry of Revenue.

02:31.400 --> 02:32.600
How could he possibly

02:32.680 --> 02:34.800
mobilize so much manpower
and transport resources?

02:34.800 --> 02:36.680
And why would he even do such a thing?

02:36.680 --> 02:39.010
[Governor of Shuntian Prefecture,
Zheng Xiaoyou]

02:37.750 --> 02:38.840
These are all

02:39.910 --> 02:40.750
assumptions.

02:41.120 --> 02:42.430
There is no evidence.

02:43.400 --> 02:45.520
I know you are eager to save your father.

02:45.520 --> 02:46.520
But for this case,

02:46.520 --> 02:49.150
the Imperial Court has ordered the three
judicial bodies to investigate the case.

02:49.150 --> 02:50.560
It is not within Shuntian Prefecture's

02:50.560 --> 02:51.420
jurisdiction.

02:51.630 --> 02:52.690
You came to cry foul

02:52.710 --> 02:53.770
at the wrong place.

02:54.020 --> 02:56.190
[Upholding the Law with Iron Resolve]

02:55.360 --> 02:56.160
You may leave.

02:56.500 --> 02:58.400
My Lord, I have evidence.

03:00.910 --> 03:02.080
Secretary of Granary
in the Ministry of Revenue,

03:02.080 --> 03:03.150
Lord Sun Shitao,

03:03.470 --> 03:06.310
oversees all incoming and outgoing
operations at Daxing Granary.

03:06.310 --> 03:07.240
But I heard that

03:07.680 --> 03:09.190
half a month before the incident,

03:09.190 --> 03:11.000
Lord Sun had not returned home.

03:11.710 --> 03:13.000
If we can find Lord Sun,

03:13.310 --> 03:14.710
we will find clear proof.

03:18.400 --> 03:20.079
In a moment of panic, Sun Shitao

03:20.079 --> 03:21.810
actually jumped into the pool.

03:21.910 --> 03:23.710
The water was rushing fast then,

03:23.870 --> 03:24.800
and it was night.

03:25.030 --> 03:27.090
He disappeared
in the blink of an eye.

03:27.520 --> 03:29.800
It's been over half a month now.

03:30.910 --> 03:32.470
What about the people who did it?

03:32.470 --> 03:33.670
Don't worry, Master.

03:33.750 --> 03:36.000
The people have been dealt with.

03:39.400 --> 03:40.310
We absolutely cannot let anyone

03:40.310 --> 03:41.640
find Sun Shitao's body,

03:42.079 --> 03:43.680
especially that Gu Jinzhao.

03:45.030 --> 03:45.910
Although this matter was

03:45.910 --> 03:47.360
tacitly approved by Xuanweng,

03:47.360 --> 03:48.079
he hasn't said

03:48.079 --> 03:49.340
a single word about it.

03:50.680 --> 03:52.079
As soon as the disaster relief grain
left the capital,

03:52.079 --> 03:53.210
he claimed to be ill.

03:53.430 --> 03:54.240
It's obvious

03:54.800 --> 03:56.310
he wants to play dirty

03:56.310 --> 03:57.310
while keeping his hands clean.

03:57.310 --> 03:58.150
It would've been fine

03:58.150 --> 04:00.080
if Sun Shitao had never been found.

04:00.150 --> 04:01.520
Once the body surfaces,

04:01.630 --> 04:03.430
given Xuanweng's personality,

04:04.520 --> 04:05.280
he would be the first

04:05.280 --> 04:06.560
to distance himself.

04:11.360 --> 04:12.080
No.

04:14.520 --> 04:15.680
Send more men.

04:16.240 --> 04:17.440
I want to see him alive

04:18.390 --> 04:19.600
or his dead body.

04:21.190 --> 04:22.160
Leave it to me.

04:22.420 --> 04:25.860
[Generations of Excellence]

04:28.120 --> 04:28.740
My Lady,

04:29.000 --> 04:29.950
Lord Zheng

04:29.950 --> 04:31.210
is hemming and hawing.

04:31.600 --> 04:32.480
It's obvious

04:32.480 --> 04:34.430
he doesn't want to investigate properly.

04:34.430 --> 04:35.240
In my opinion,

04:35.510 --> 04:37.190
I bet the moment we reported it,

04:37.190 --> 04:37.870
he went straight

04:37.870 --> 04:39.600
to report it to those old lords.

04:42.270 --> 04:43.310
I actually hope they

04:43.310 --> 04:44.159
blow this matter

04:44.159 --> 04:45.890
completely out of proportion.

04:47.630 --> 04:48.390
So next,

04:48.390 --> 04:49.520
what you need to do is

04:49.870 --> 04:51.510
try every possible means

04:51.800 --> 04:53.040
to stall this case.

04:53.720 --> 04:55.120
The longer it's stalled,

04:55.310 --> 04:57.360
the more room you have to maneuver.

04:58.830 --> 04:59.720
This time,

05:00.240 --> 05:01.630
disaster really struck us out of nowhere

05:01.630 --> 05:03.510
while we were just sitting at home.

05:03.510 --> 05:04.710
I see it clearly now.

05:05.070 --> 05:06.190
These grand lords,

05:06.610 --> 05:08.070
in their scramble for power and profit,

05:08.070 --> 05:08.830
don't treat others' lives

05:08.830 --> 05:10.270
as lives at all.

05:11.920 --> 05:14.250
In the past, when I
was with my grandmother

05:14.480 --> 05:16.390
and saw her dealing
with the Imperial Court,

05:16.390 --> 05:18.390
I only ever thought about escaping.

05:19.600 --> 05:20.680
Today I realize

05:21.160 --> 05:22.920
that it's actually unavoidable,

05:22.920 --> 05:25.650
so it's better to face
the difficulties head-on.

05:26.110 --> 05:27.180
I just hope

05:27.510 --> 05:28.930
my diversion tactic

05:29.000 --> 05:30.220
will be effective.

05:30.720 --> 05:31.560
So they will be late to discover

05:31.560 --> 05:32.720
Ye Xian's movements,

05:32.720 --> 05:33.430
allowing Ye Xian

05:33.430 --> 05:35.360
to bring the evidence back sooner.

05:35.720 --> 05:36.980
Third Master is right.

05:37.159 --> 05:38.870
Having suffered so many losses,

05:38.870 --> 05:40.200
it's time to fight back.

05:45.870 --> 05:47.830
Hyah! Hyah! Hyah!

05:50.070 --> 05:51.030
Are you saying

05:51.240 --> 05:53.100
that Wang Xuanfan ordered his men

05:53.190 --> 05:54.750
to replace the relief grain sent to Shanxi

05:54.750 --> 05:55.870
with bran?

05:59.510 --> 06:00.640
By my calculations,

06:01.000 --> 06:02.160
in two days at most,

06:02.680 --> 06:05.610
an urgent report
from Shanxi will reach the capital.

06:06.040 --> 06:07.840
Then wouldn't you be in trouble?

06:08.560 --> 06:10.560
But what does this have to do with me?

06:11.390 --> 06:13.830
Gu Dezhao, Director of the Treasury
in the Ministry of Revenue,

06:13.830 --> 06:15.560
is in charge of Daxing Granary.

06:18.830 --> 06:20.150
Then tell Gu Jinzhao

06:20.310 --> 06:21.430
to come and beg me herself.

06:21.430 --> 06:23.830
Isn't your eldest sister
also a member of the Gu family?

06:23.830 --> 06:25.920
Given Zhang Ling's grudge against you,

06:25.920 --> 06:26.830
he won't

06:26.830 --> 06:28.310
just arrest Gu Dezhao.

06:29.240 --> 06:30.800
Perhaps the entire Gu family

06:30.800 --> 06:31.930
will be implicated.

06:34.510 --> 06:35.840
What do you want me to do?

06:36.940 --> 06:38.270
Go to Pingyang Mansion.

06:38.390 --> 06:41.120
Bring back
the relevant witnesses and evidence.

06:43.950 --> 06:44.920
Father said

06:45.560 --> 06:46.680
the current situation

06:46.680 --> 06:47.680
may seem on the surface

06:47.680 --> 06:49.680
like a mistake
with the disaster relief grain,

06:49.680 --> 06:51.310
but it's actually
a factional struggle

06:51.310 --> 06:53.170
between Fu Hailian and Fan Chuan.

06:53.270 --> 06:54.010
Right now,

06:54.120 --> 06:55.630
Fan Chuan is so sick
he can't get out of bed.

06:55.630 --> 06:56.630
Anyone can see that

06:56.630 --> 06:58.830
Fu Hailian will definitely win completely.

06:58.830 --> 07:00.300
It's not good for him to

07:00.600 --> 07:02.930
exonerate our mansion at a time like this.

07:04.360 --> 07:06.390
The old Marquis is the top
of the military nobility.

07:06.390 --> 07:08.270
If he doesn't dare to, who would?

07:09.160 --> 07:10.600
Exactly, Fifth Aunt.

07:10.950 --> 07:13.150
Please go and beg the old Marquis again.

07:13.310 --> 07:14.000
Besides...

07:14.680 --> 07:16.720
Besides, Jinxian is still in prison.

07:16.720 --> 07:18.430
Will the old Marquis not even help

07:18.430 --> 07:19.570
his own grandson?

07:20.000 --> 07:21.190
I mentioned Jinxian,

07:21.190 --> 07:22.030
but Father...

07:23.870 --> 07:24.600
I think

07:24.830 --> 07:26.290
he's probably unwilling.

07:26.720 --> 07:27.310
Mother.

07:27.430 --> 07:28.750
I'm sorry.

07:32.450 --> 07:33.830
Useless thing.

07:33.830 --> 07:35.360
Mother, please calm down.

07:37.159 --> 07:38.400
And to think

07:39.000 --> 07:40.240
I treated you

07:40.240 --> 07:41.440
like my own daughter.

07:41.920 --> 07:43.310
And I treated the Marquis

07:43.310 --> 07:44.870
with the utmost respect.

07:45.800 --> 07:47.800
Now that our Gu family is in trouble,

07:47.870 --> 07:48.730
what about you?

07:49.360 --> 07:50.430
One says they don't dare,

07:50.430 --> 07:52.390
and another says they're unwilling.

07:52.390 --> 07:52.920
Mother.

07:52.920 --> 07:55.180
And that biological brother of yours...

07:55.240 --> 07:56.270
He actually brought men

07:56.270 --> 07:57.830
to arrest his own in-laws.

07:58.630 --> 08:00.230
No wonder people outside say

08:00.920 --> 08:02.480
that the people in the Penal Court

08:02.480 --> 08:04.310
are all cold-hearted

08:04.310 --> 08:05.390
and inhuman.

08:05.580 --> 08:07.840
Looks to me like everyone in the Ye family

08:07.870 --> 08:08.720
is a bunch

08:09.680 --> 08:11.760
of ungrateful ingrates.

08:12.750 --> 08:13.550
Grandmother.

08:13.630 --> 08:14.800
What are you saying?

08:15.000 --> 08:16.540
Jinxian is also locked up in prison.

08:16.540 --> 08:17.360
Do you think Fifth Aunt

08:17.360 --> 08:19.420
would intentionally refuse to help?

08:20.090 --> 08:21.760
Stop being so hypocritical.

08:22.720 --> 08:23.580
If you ask me,

08:24.040 --> 08:24.870
this whole thing

08:24.870 --> 08:26.730
was caused by your fourth branch.

08:27.480 --> 08:28.360
We shouldn't have

08:28.360 --> 08:29.920
let you return
to the Gu family in the first place.

08:29.920 --> 08:31.360
I think that fortune teller back then

08:31.360 --> 08:32.620
was absolutely right.

08:34.030 --> 08:35.510
You are a jinx.

08:36.750 --> 08:37.390
No.

08:38.270 --> 08:40.870
Your entire fourth branch
is a bunch of jinxes.

08:40.870 --> 08:42.320
Whoever takes you in gets unlucky.

08:42.320 --> 08:43.080
Lian.

08:43.080 --> 08:43.720
Mother!

08:44.120 --> 08:45.930
Wenxiu told me everything.

08:46.670 --> 08:48.390
Fourth Uncle abused
his power for personal gain

08:48.390 --> 08:49.320
and replaced the disaster relief grain

08:49.320 --> 08:50.810
with bran to send to the victims.

08:50.810 --> 08:52.570
We've all been ruined by him.

09:01.080 --> 09:03.030
How dare you hit me!

09:03.270 --> 09:04.800
I told you to shut up!

09:05.120 --> 09:07.240
Zhao, you're too presumptuous!

09:08.060 --> 09:10.120
12,000 tons of disaster relief grain

09:10.150 --> 09:12.750
was replaced with bran
and sent to the victims.

09:12.790 --> 09:14.250
What a grave crime this is.

09:14.960 --> 09:17.030
Our property will be confiscated
and our clan wiped out.

09:17.030 --> 09:17.830
None of us here

09:18.800 --> 09:20.060
will be able to escape.

09:23.390 --> 09:24.030
But you...

09:25.240 --> 09:27.030
The court hasn't convicted him yet,

09:27.030 --> 09:29.290
and you've already condemned him first.

09:29.290 --> 09:30.550
Do you think we are not dying fast enough,

09:30.550 --> 09:31.200
don't you?

09:32.150 --> 09:32.550
I...

09:33.270 --> 09:34.440
I don't know.

09:34.440 --> 09:35.500
-Mother.
-Enough.

09:36.720 --> 09:38.400
Lian is already grounded.

09:39.360 --> 09:41.020
She has no filter on her mouth.

09:41.030 --> 09:41.790
She keeps listening to

09:41.790 --> 09:43.150
all the rumors outside

09:43.150 --> 09:44.750
and repeating them blindly.

09:47.200 --> 09:48.930
Now that disaster is imminent,

09:49.390 --> 09:50.720
we should unite.

09:51.750 --> 09:54.010
We can't throw ourselves into disarray.

09:54.670 --> 09:55.870
All of you, step down.

09:56.330 --> 09:58.060
I have something to say to Zhao.

09:58.510 --> 09:59.240
Yes.

09:59.750 --> 10:00.720
Step down.

10:04.480 --> 10:05.240
Step down!

10:05.910 --> 10:06.440
Let's go.

10:13.440 --> 10:14.150
Zhao.

10:14.670 --> 10:15.630
Is there any news

10:15.840 --> 10:17.370
from Shuntian Prefecture?

10:19.840 --> 10:20.910
The Governor of Shuntian Prefecture

10:20.910 --> 10:22.240
has been making excuses

10:22.360 --> 10:23.890
and refuses to hold a trial.

10:24.360 --> 10:26.640
He must be instructed by someone

10:26.910 --> 10:28.270
to deliberately obstruct us.

10:28.270 --> 10:29.780
It seems that our Gu family

10:30.390 --> 10:31.910
is suffering collateral damage

10:31.910 --> 10:34.110
with nowhere to appeal our grievances.

10:34.480 --> 10:35.320
I heard that

10:35.510 --> 10:37.750
the Administrative Commissioner of Shanxi
has also pleaded guilty.

10:37.750 --> 10:38.680
D-Does that mean

10:38.790 --> 10:40.850
we just have to sit and wait for death?

10:41.390 --> 10:42.190
Grandmother,

10:42.480 --> 10:43.210
don't panic.

10:44.080 --> 10:45.480
This time, Second Uncle and Jinxian

10:45.480 --> 10:45.960
are implicated

10:45.960 --> 10:47.240
because of my father.

10:47.870 --> 10:49.910
Even if I have to beat
the Drum of Grievance

10:49.910 --> 10:51.120
and make a scene
in the Golden Celestial Hall,

10:51.120 --> 10:52.120
I will definitely find a way

10:52.120 --> 10:53.080
to save them.

10:55.440 --> 10:56.600
Zhao... Zhao.

10:56.960 --> 10:58.870
If you can save Deyuan,

10:59.200 --> 11:00.360
everyone in the Gu Mansion

11:00.360 --> 11:01.550
will be deeply grateful to you.

11:01.550 --> 11:03.080
Grandmother, please rise.

11:03.200 --> 11:04.060
You shouldn't.

11:05.200 --> 11:06.000
Grandmother.

11:07.150 --> 11:08.150
Please stay calm.

11:09.550 --> 11:10.440
Right now,

11:10.910 --> 11:12.200
I still need your help.

11:15.750 --> 11:17.010
Here's the situation.

11:17.150 --> 11:18.360
To beat the Drum of Grievance,

11:18.360 --> 11:20.690
we need permission from the authorities.

11:20.840 --> 11:22.370
I need you to go to the prison

11:22.720 --> 11:23.850
to see Second Uncle.

11:24.750 --> 11:25.200
Okay.

11:25.750 --> 11:26.240
Okay.

11:40.060 --> 11:41.320
The Drum of Grievance.

11:43.200 --> 11:45.410
If Shuntian Prefecture
delays accepting the case,

11:45.410 --> 11:46.340
at worst,

11:46.360 --> 11:47.670
I will go beat the Drum of Grievance.

11:47.670 --> 11:48.470
That won't do.

11:49.190 --> 11:51.080
Our dynasty is different
from the previous one.

11:51.080 --> 11:52.480
To beat the Drum of Grievance,

11:52.480 --> 11:54.200
regardless of right and wrong,

11:54.200 --> 11:55.160
at worst, you could be sentenced

11:55.160 --> 11:56.690
to 40 strokes of the paddle.

11:56.960 --> 11:57.670
But this

11:57.950 --> 11:59.250
is the best way.

11:59.630 --> 12:01.490
I won't allow you to do it this way.

12:06.130 --> 12:08.330
Why won't she listen?

12:17.120 --> 12:18.080
Guards!

12:19.320 --> 12:24.220
[The Cold Iron Judge]

12:19.670 --> 12:21.270
Greetings, Governor.

12:25.320 --> 12:26.190
Gu Jinzhao.

12:26.440 --> 12:27.840
You have quite the nerve.

12:28.600 --> 12:30.960
You actually dared to
beat the Drum of Grievance?

12:30.960 --> 12:32.480
According to the laws of Great Yan,

12:32.480 --> 12:33.840
whoever beats the Drum of Grievance,

12:33.840 --> 12:35.080
before stating their case,

12:35.080 --> 12:36.490
must first receive 40 strokes.

12:36.490 --> 12:39.120
[Upholding the Law with Iron Resolve]

12:36.670 --> 12:37.200
Men!

12:37.600 --> 12:38.200
Wait.

12:40.430 --> 12:41.030
My Lord,

12:41.670 --> 12:42.960
according to the laws of Great Yan,

12:42.960 --> 12:44.400
striking the Drum of Grievance
without authorization

12:44.400 --> 12:46.130
does indeed warrant 40 lashes.

12:46.200 --> 12:48.360
But I did not act without authorization.

12:48.360 --> 12:50.000
According to the laws of Great Yan,

12:50.000 --> 12:51.750
I first cried out my grievances
to the Investigating Censor,

12:51.750 --> 12:53.390
and obtained his permission

12:53.550 --> 12:54.680
before coming here.

12:55.150 --> 12:55.790
What?

12:57.360 --> 12:58.820
You went to the Censorate?

13:01.150 --> 13:03.950
Which Investigating Censor
gave you permission?

13:04.030 --> 13:05.390
Assistant Censor-in-Chief,

13:05.390 --> 13:06.160
Gu Deyuan.

13:10.700 --> 13:11.390
My Lord.

13:12.550 --> 13:13.630
The Gu family indeed

13:13.630 --> 13:15.200
visited the Penal Court prison

13:15.200 --> 13:16.000
yesterday.

13:18.550 --> 13:20.390
Although my second uncle is in prison,

13:20.390 --> 13:21.630
he is only awaiting trial.

13:21.630 --> 13:22.630
He has not been convicted,

13:22.630 --> 13:23.910
and his authority remains.

13:23.910 --> 13:25.110
He heard my grievance

13:25.480 --> 13:27.880
and allowed me
to beat the drum for justice.

13:28.320 --> 13:29.390
That is why I came.

13:31.510 --> 13:32.970
Here is the written order.

13:33.150 --> 13:34.240
It is reasonable.

13:35.670 --> 13:36.440
Well said!

13:36.440 --> 13:37.200
Makes sense!

13:40.200 --> 13:41.120
Indeed reasonable.

13:41.120 --> 13:41.600
Yeah.

13:41.670 --> 13:42.410
Right.

13:42.480 --> 13:43.000
Exactly.

13:43.000 --> 13:43.720
Well said.

13:43.720 --> 13:44.520
That's right.

13:53.030 --> 13:53.870
Since

13:54.600 --> 13:56.790
you have the imperial censor's permission,

13:56.790 --> 13:58.080
there's no need for the beating.

13:58.080 --> 13:59.200
What is your grievance?

13:59.200 --> 13:59.720
Speak.

14:00.910 --> 14:01.790
My Lord,

14:02.440 --> 14:03.240
I have found the body

14:03.240 --> 14:04.360
of Lord Sun Shitao,

14:04.600 --> 14:07.530
the Secretary of Granary
of the Ministry of Revenue.

14:08.670 --> 14:09.510
What?

14:10.360 --> 14:11.020
Where is it?

14:12.030 --> 14:14.090
Right outside Shuntian Prefecture.

14:19.440 --> 14:20.830
How could this be?

14:21.030 --> 14:22.840
I clearly have the body.

14:23.960 --> 14:24.390
Sir,

14:24.670 --> 14:26.130
Sun Shitao has been found.

14:27.870 --> 14:30.200
His face is completely
bloated from soaking.

14:30.200 --> 14:31.460
The clothes are right.

14:32.840 --> 14:33.620
All right.

14:33.910 --> 14:34.790
Take it away quickly.

14:34.790 --> 14:35.200
Yes.

14:42.720 --> 14:43.910
Could it be fake?

14:45.720 --> 14:47.300
Yuanweng! Yuanweng!

14:48.080 --> 14:48.910
What's wrong?

14:48.910 --> 14:49.910
Why the panic?

14:53.670 --> 14:54.790
Gu Jinzhao found

14:54.790 --> 14:55.850
Sun Shitao's body.

14:55.870 --> 14:58.440
It has just been sent
to the Shuntian Prefecture office.

14:58.440 --> 14:58.840
How...

14:59.480 --> 15:00.440
How is this possible?

15:00.440 --> 15:01.750
It's absolutely true.

15:02.550 --> 15:03.840
My men already found

15:03.840 --> 15:05.120
Sun Shitao's body last night.

15:05.120 --> 15:05.670
Where did

15:05.670 --> 15:07.000
another one pop up from?

15:09.790 --> 15:11.630
Could the one I found be a fake?

15:13.560 --> 15:15.200
Whether that body is really his or not,

15:15.200 --> 15:16.360
didn't I tell you

15:16.840 --> 15:18.320
to make sure Zheng Xiaoyou

15:18.320 --> 15:19.720
wouldn't hear Gu Jinzhao's case?

15:19.720 --> 15:21.360
Lord Zheng didn't hold a hearing for her,

15:21.360 --> 15:24.690
but he couldn't stop her
from beating the Drum of Grievance.

15:26.630 --> 15:28.760
I could tell when she toasted that day.

15:28.870 --> 15:29.740
This woman

15:29.780 --> 15:31.260
is just a hothead.

15:33.060 --> 15:33.970
It's here.

15:34.030 --> 15:34.520
Look.

15:34.550 --> 15:35.810
What does he look like?

15:36.500 --> 15:37.500
I don't know.

15:39.080 --> 15:40.340
What does he look like?

15:50.270 --> 15:51.200
My Lord,

15:51.200 --> 15:52.600
it is indeed Sun Shitao.

15:53.910 --> 15:55.510
Where did you find the body?

15:56.080 --> 15:56.710
My Lord,

15:57.080 --> 15:58.960
I ordered my family's servants

15:59.080 --> 16:00.940
to fish it out of the Tongfu River.

16:02.390 --> 16:03.510
After my father was imprisoned,

16:03.510 --> 16:04.320
I ordered

16:04.320 --> 16:05.480
people to search everywhere

16:05.480 --> 16:07.080
for Lord Sun's whereabouts.

16:07.080 --> 16:07.880
I learned that

16:08.030 --> 16:08.550
Lord Sun

16:08.550 --> 16:10.080
was last seen in public

16:10.360 --> 16:12.000
on the second day of this month.

16:12.000 --> 16:13.000
which was five days before

16:13.000 --> 16:14.860
the relief grain was dispatched.

16:15.030 --> 16:15.870
That afternoon,

16:15.870 --> 16:17.200
someone saw Lord Sun

16:17.360 --> 16:18.960
at a carriage agency in Qipan Alley

16:18.960 --> 16:20.230
hiring a carriage.

16:20.360 --> 16:21.270
He said he would return

16:21.270 --> 16:23.400
to his hometown in Bozhou the next day.

16:23.510 --> 16:24.370
Later that day,

16:24.600 --> 16:25.730
someone saw

16:25.960 --> 16:26.840
him in Hongmen

16:27.000 --> 16:28.170
drinking with a man.

16:28.630 --> 16:30.630
After that, he was never seen again.

16:30.750 --> 16:32.350
Next to Hongmen is Nanhaizi.

16:32.480 --> 16:33.540
I figured

16:33.720 --> 16:35.600
if Lord Sun was murdered,

16:35.870 --> 16:36.480
the body

16:36.630 --> 16:38.760
would be thrown into the water nearby.

16:38.840 --> 16:40.750
Since it rained for several days in a row,

16:40.750 --> 16:42.680
the body drifted with the current.

16:42.840 --> 16:44.080
I ordered people

16:44.080 --> 16:46.030
to search the lower reaches
of the Tongfu River.

16:46.030 --> 16:48.290
And unexpectedly, we actually found it.

16:48.750 --> 16:51.720
But then we ran into
someone trying to snatch the body.

16:51.720 --> 16:52.850
Out of desperation,

16:53.000 --> 16:54.600
we used a fake body as a decoy.

16:55.200 --> 16:56.790
That is how I brought this evidence

16:56.790 --> 16:57.840
to the court.

16:58.240 --> 17:00.720
You made quite a scene.

17:02.120 --> 17:04.109
You must have sent out a lot of people.

17:04.109 --> 17:05.640
I didn't expect Director Gu

17:05.680 --> 17:06.640
to have such a

17:06.640 --> 17:07.829
capable daughter.

17:08.550 --> 17:09.880
You flatter me, My Lord.

17:10.480 --> 17:11.829
It is not about being capable.

17:11.829 --> 17:13.160
It's just that heavy rewards

17:13.160 --> 17:14.890
will surely attract brave men.

17:15.640 --> 17:16.700
By the way, My Lord,

17:17.069 --> 17:18.160
my servants found

17:18.550 --> 17:20.069
after retrieving the body,

17:20.069 --> 17:21.380
that on Lord Sun's neck

17:21.480 --> 17:23.240
there was a deep strangulation mark.

17:23.240 --> 17:24.349
It can be inferred that

17:24.349 --> 17:26.270
Lord Sun did not accidentally drown,

17:26.270 --> 17:27.480
but was strangled to death

17:27.480 --> 17:28.940
and thrown into the water.

17:31.070 --> 17:31.670
Nonsense!

17:32.350 --> 17:33.010
As for this,

17:33.200 --> 17:34.590
we must wait for the coroner's examination

17:34.590 --> 17:35.750
before drawing a conclusion.

17:35.750 --> 17:38.210
How dare you
make reckless assertions here!

17:39.160 --> 17:39.720
Enough.

17:40.160 --> 17:40.880
The autopsy

17:41.480 --> 17:42.880
will take a few more days.

17:43.000 --> 17:44.400
Go back and wait for news.

17:45.440 --> 17:46.570
Court is adjourned.

17:47.480 --> 17:48.830
My Lord, wait.

17:51.720 --> 17:52.920
What else do you want?

17:53.240 --> 17:53.790
My Lord.

17:56.160 --> 17:57.400
Fellow townsfolk.

17:58.070 --> 17:59.480
I, Gu Jinzhao,

17:59.480 --> 18:01.540
am here to seek justice for my father.

18:01.830 --> 18:03.680
My father, the Director of the Treasury
of the Ministry of Revenue,

18:03.680 --> 18:04.350
Gu Dezhao,

18:04.510 --> 18:06.000
was framed.

18:06.310 --> 18:08.970
He would never
embezzle disaster relief grain.

18:09.030 --> 18:09.680
For this,

18:10.030 --> 18:12.490
I am willing to donate
50,000 taels of silver

18:12.590 --> 18:14.510
to the refugees
of Pingyang Prefecture in Shanxi.

18:14.510 --> 18:15.670
I also have

18:15.720 --> 18:17.400
300 tons of stored grain in Shanxi,

18:17.400 --> 18:19.600
which I am now willing to donate as well.

18:19.720 --> 18:21.000
I only beg the Imperial Court

18:21.000 --> 18:22.680
to thoroughly investigate this case

18:22.680 --> 18:23.790
and restore my father

18:23.790 --> 18:24.550
and the Gu Mansion

18:24.550 --> 18:25.920
to full innocence.

18:26.750 --> 18:28.440
-Great!
-Great!

18:28.550 --> 18:30.260
Gu Jinzhao is so rich.

18:30.640 --> 18:32.680
How could her father embezzle?

18:32.710 --> 18:33.310
Exactly.

18:33.310 --> 18:34.620
He must be wrongly accused!

18:34.620 --> 18:35.840
Don't you agree?

18:36.200 --> 18:37.950
Yes, he's wronged.

18:38.340 --> 18:39.350
Come on, everyone say it.

18:39.350 --> 18:40.590
Clear his names!

18:40.590 --> 18:41.660
Clear his names!

18:41.790 --> 18:43.200
Clear his names!

18:43.510 --> 18:44.440
Clear his names!

18:44.560 --> 18:46.150
Clear his names!

18:46.310 --> 18:47.790
Donating 50,000 taels of silver

18:47.790 --> 18:49.100
and 300 tons of grain.

18:49.350 --> 18:50.750
What a generous gesture.

18:51.480 --> 18:53.810
Have the silver and grain been deposited?

18:54.680 --> 18:55.480
Your Majesty,

18:55.890 --> 18:57.070
the Gu family has handed over the silver

18:57.070 --> 18:58.240
to Shuntian Prefecture.

18:58.240 --> 18:59.770
As for the 300 tons of grain,

18:59.830 --> 19:01.200
according to Gu Jinzhao,

19:01.200 --> 19:02.640
at the beginning of the drought,

19:02.640 --> 19:03.400
she ordered the Ji family

19:03.400 --> 19:05.110
to purchase it at their branch in Shanxi.

19:05.110 --> 19:06.480
A carrier pigeon has been sent,

19:06.480 --> 19:07.480
ordering the grain

19:07.480 --> 19:08.920
to be transferred to
the Provincial Administration Commission.

19:08.920 --> 19:09.720
The Ji family?

19:10.750 --> 19:13.110
Is it the Ji family
in Tongzhou that took the lead

19:13.110 --> 19:15.270
in land reform
and made great contributions?

19:15.270 --> 19:16.110
Your Majesty,

19:16.310 --> 19:17.840
it is indeed that Ji family.

19:18.440 --> 19:19.720
Then what is the relationship

19:19.720 --> 19:21.920
between the Ji family and the Gu family?

19:22.680 --> 19:23.480
Your Majesty,

19:24.550 --> 19:26.400
the Ji family is Director Gu's
father-in-law's family.

19:26.400 --> 19:28.160
The head of the Ji family, Lady Wu,

19:28.160 --> 19:30.360
is Gu Jinzhao's maternal grandmother.

19:31.070 --> 19:32.310
Since the Ji family

19:32.310 --> 19:34.110
can take the lead in land reform,

19:34.200 --> 19:35.200
would Gu Dezhao

19:35.200 --> 19:37.160
still need to embezzle
disaster relief grain?

19:37.160 --> 19:37.680
Isn't this

19:37.680 --> 19:39.080
absolutely ridiculous?

19:39.750 --> 19:41.350
You are right, Your Majesty.

19:41.350 --> 19:43.680
It was indeed the officials' negligence.

19:43.740 --> 19:48.990
[Honor and Illumination]

19:43.920 --> 19:45.780
I think it's not just negligence,

19:46.000 --> 19:47.200
but something fishy.

19:47.400 --> 19:48.060
Zhang Fang.

19:48.640 --> 19:50.830
Bring me the files related to this case.

19:50.830 --> 19:52.350
I want to take a good look.

19:52.590 --> 19:53.750
Yes, Your Majesty.

19:59.310 --> 20:01.720
Wang Xuanfan is an idiot.

20:03.350 --> 20:04.590
All ambition,

20:05.160 --> 20:06.350
no ability.

20:06.690 --> 20:09.390
A sage ruler attracts good ministers

20:06.880 --> 20:09.540
Talking about killing
two birds with one stone.

20:09.640 --> 20:11.240
Taking down Fan Chuan on one hand,

20:11.240 --> 20:13.030
and striking Jiuheng on the other.

20:13.030 --> 20:14.320
What a perfect setup.

20:14.830 --> 20:16.160
It's full of loopholes.

20:16.510 --> 20:17.350
Go and tell him

20:18.880 --> 20:20.340
to clean up the loose ends.

20:21.160 --> 20:21.680
Yes.

20:25.550 --> 20:26.940
How is Chen Jiuheng?

20:26.920 --> 20:31.530
A sage ruler attracts good ministers

20:27.110 --> 20:27.830
My Lord,

20:28.110 --> 20:30.160
he is still serving
his sentence in prison.

20:30.160 --> 20:31.790
I was just about to report to you.

20:31.790 --> 20:33.720
Zhang Ling sent a message earlier,

20:33.920 --> 20:36.480
saying Lord Chen wants to meet you.

20:58.920 --> 21:00.720
I pay my respects to you, Mentor.

21:00.880 --> 21:02.940
I didn't expect you to come in person.

21:05.960 --> 21:07.240
I wanted to get you out.

21:07.240 --> 21:09.350
But the case is not closed.

21:09.920 --> 21:11.120
It is not appropriate

21:11.200 --> 21:12.750
to act recklessly.

21:13.030 --> 21:13.920
I understand.

21:14.590 --> 21:15.510
You said you wanted to see me.

21:15.510 --> 21:16.200
What is it?

21:19.160 --> 21:21.160
I want to ask you

21:22.920 --> 21:24.320
to protect the Gu family.

21:24.880 --> 21:26.720
Is it because of the Ji family?

21:27.440 --> 21:28.030
No.

21:30.240 --> 21:31.400
It is...

21:31.720 --> 21:32.720
It is because

21:32.920 --> 21:34.450
I have feelings for Miss Gu.

21:36.510 --> 21:37.640
I mean Gu Jinzhao.

21:43.440 --> 21:44.240
Really?

21:44.920 --> 21:45.400
Really.

21:45.920 --> 21:47.850
You've never mentioned it before.

21:49.030 --> 21:50.750
I didn't realize it before either.

21:50.750 --> 21:52.920
Ever since
the relief grain case broke out,

21:52.920 --> 21:53.680
I wasn't

21:54.160 --> 21:55.760
worried about myself at all.

21:56.160 --> 21:58.480
Instead, I kept worrying
about the Gu family.

21:58.480 --> 21:59.550
That's when I realized

21:59.550 --> 22:00.350
that...

22:01.400 --> 22:02.200
that I

22:02.200 --> 22:03.730
had already fallen for her.

22:07.960 --> 22:09.440
I see.

22:11.750 --> 22:12.640
Yuanweng

22:13.550 --> 22:15.410
set a trap to bring down Fan Chuan.

22:16.000 --> 22:18.160
Now that Fan Chuan's power is gone,

22:19.310 --> 22:20.720
I was just thinking

22:21.550 --> 22:23.410
if we could protect the Gu family.

22:23.680 --> 22:24.510
This way,

22:25.000 --> 22:26.400
I can give Gu Jinzhao,

22:26.400 --> 22:27.310
Miss Gu,

22:28.310 --> 22:29.570
a proper explanation.

22:33.110 --> 22:34.310
I can help you

22:34.680 --> 22:36.010
with this little thing.

22:37.100 --> 22:40.210
Although Gu Jinzhao
is from a merchant family,

22:40.880 --> 22:43.000
she is quite talented.

22:43.200 --> 22:44.660
She is a good match for you.

22:46.400 --> 22:46.880
Okay.

22:47.530 --> 22:51.530
[The Heart as a Polished Mirror]

22:51.630 --> 22:59.580
A sage ruler attracts good ministers

22:52.160 --> 22:54.420
If the disaster relief grain hadn't been

22:55.790 --> 22:57.550
replaced with bran,

22:57.550 --> 22:59.350
I really wouldn't have known.

23:00.200 --> 23:01.550
From the sixth-rank

23:02.110 --> 23:03.590
Secretary of Granary,

23:03.790 --> 23:07.200
all the way up to
the Vice Minister of Revenue,

23:07.200 --> 23:09.110
every last one of them
took bribes, embezzled funds,

23:09.110 --> 23:11.200
and sold off government grain in secret.

23:11.200 --> 23:13.470
This is just one Daxing Granary.

23:13.540 --> 23:15.340
If this is really investigated,

23:15.640 --> 23:20.100
who knows how many other granaries across
Great Yan have suffered the same fate?

23:26.440 --> 23:28.810
If the new tax reform

23:28.920 --> 23:30.590
hadn't reached a critical stage,

23:30.590 --> 23:32.310
making a major trial inadvisable,

23:32.310 --> 23:33.310
I would definitely investigate

23:33.310 --> 23:35.310
this grain reserve case to the end.

23:35.440 --> 23:36.300
How about this?

23:40.030 --> 23:42.560
For corrupt officials
above the fourth rank,

23:42.750 --> 23:44.150
the principal offenders

23:45.400 --> 23:46.260
can be beheaded

23:47.350 --> 23:49.480
or sentenced to death with a reprieve.

23:50.030 --> 23:51.350
Punish them severely and quickly

23:51.350 --> 23:52.610
as a warning to others.

23:53.110 --> 23:54.310
As for the others...

23:55.400 --> 23:56.550
For example,

23:57.510 --> 23:59.110
Director of the Ministry of Revenue,

23:59.110 --> 23:59.960
Gu Dezhao.

24:00.510 --> 24:02.640
He has seriously neglected his duties

24:02.880 --> 24:04.640
and should be strictly punished.

24:04.640 --> 24:05.790
But considering

24:07.240 --> 24:08.500
he was deceived,

24:08.530 --> 24:09.460
and his daughter

24:09.680 --> 24:11.350
donated money and grain,

24:15.640 --> 24:17.200
let it make up for his crimes.

24:17.200 --> 24:17.750
So,

24:18.590 --> 24:19.880
demote him...

24:20.550 --> 24:22.280
Demote him to the seventh rank.

24:22.480 --> 24:25.530
Find a county in Pingyang

24:26.350 --> 24:28.010
and let him be the magistrate.

24:28.550 --> 24:29.820
Let him experience

24:29.850 --> 24:31.310
the hardships of the poor.

24:31.790 --> 24:33.380
As for the other one,

24:33.440 --> 24:34.440
Zhao Jichang,

24:35.720 --> 24:37.720
the case involving his collusion with
grain merchants and embezzlement

24:37.720 --> 24:39.000
must continue to be investigated.

24:39.000 --> 24:40.720
But the scope shouldn't be expanded.

24:40.720 --> 24:41.750
As for Fan Chuan's

24:42.110 --> 24:44.040
memorial requesting retirement,

24:45.880 --> 24:47.940
His Majesty has already approved it.

24:50.310 --> 24:51.720
Nothing much

24:55.750 --> 24:56.830
besides that.

24:59.790 --> 25:00.990
-Yes, Sir.
-Yes, Sir.

25:03.640 --> 25:04.240
Xuanweng.

25:05.350 --> 25:06.110
Then

25:06.550 --> 25:07.720
what about Jiuheng?

25:12.350 --> 25:15.160
We really did him wrong in this matter.

25:16.880 --> 25:18.880
Hurry up and get him out of prison.

25:19.510 --> 25:20.480
This case originally

25:20.480 --> 25:21.940
had nothing to do with him.

25:22.030 --> 25:24.510
There was just a problem
with the Ministry of Revenue.

25:24.510 --> 25:26.710
He supervises the Ministry of Revenue.

25:30.550 --> 25:32.410
Relieve him of his duties for now.

25:33.030 --> 25:34.630
After all, he is still young.

25:35.560 --> 25:37.360
Keeping a low profile for a while

25:37.420 --> 25:42.180
[A sage ruler attracts good ministers]

25:38.110 --> 25:39.370
won't be a big problem.

25:41.400 --> 25:42.600
-Yes, Sir.
-Yes, Sir.

25:46.790 --> 25:47.590
Open the door!

25:57.310 --> 25:59.350
Lord Zhang, what happened?

26:00.510 --> 26:02.510
Ye Xian went to Pingyang.

26:07.110 --> 26:09.240
Didn't you know about this, Lord Chen?

26:09.640 --> 26:11.110
How would I know?

26:11.880 --> 26:12.940
I don't believe it.

26:15.270 --> 26:17.000
Did you ask him to go?

26:17.160 --> 26:19.090
Why would you say that, Lord Zhang?

26:19.240 --> 26:21.070
Why would I ask Ye Xian to go?

26:22.110 --> 26:23.110
Because you were resentful

26:23.110 --> 26:25.310
that Wang Xuanfan set a trap to harm you.

26:25.510 --> 26:27.440
Then why would Ye Xian listen to me?

26:27.830 --> 26:29.560
Because you helped him before.

26:30.270 --> 26:31.480
In Prince Ruichang's treason case,

26:31.480 --> 26:33.280
it was you who tipped off Ye Xian.

26:33.590 --> 26:34.400
You think you

26:34.400 --> 26:35.440
did it flawlessly,

26:35.440 --> 26:36.440
but don't forget,

26:37.000 --> 26:39.400
the Penal Court supervises all officials.

26:39.440 --> 26:40.720
I know your secrets.

26:44.270 --> 26:46.920
Doesn't the Penal Court rely on evidence?

26:48.350 --> 26:51.080
These are all just
your wild guesses, Lord Zhang.

26:52.920 --> 26:54.010
So what?

26:54.640 --> 26:55.790
As for evidence,

26:56.550 --> 26:58.480
I can fabricate it whenever I want.

27:08.070 --> 27:09.440
Lord Zhang, are you

27:09.920 --> 27:11.030
trying to frame me?

27:12.160 --> 27:13.560
I just don't understand.

27:14.000 --> 27:15.270
Even if I was the one

27:15.270 --> 27:16.930
who asked Ye Xian to Pingyang,

27:17.720 --> 27:18.980
why are you so anxious?

27:20.350 --> 27:22.150
He wasn't targeting you anyway.

27:23.240 --> 27:24.000
Or is it...

27:24.000 --> 27:24.510
You...

27:26.830 --> 27:27.480
Do you believe

27:27.480 --> 27:28.590
I'll kill you right now?

27:28.590 --> 27:29.510
Do you dare?

27:31.070 --> 27:32.930
I am a dignified Senior Minister.

27:33.070 --> 27:34.200
If you don't kill me,

27:34.640 --> 27:36.970
there might still be a chance of survival.

27:37.110 --> 27:38.400
If you kill me,

27:39.480 --> 27:40.680
I'm afraid you won't even

27:40.680 --> 27:42.010
make it out of this door.

27:52.430 --> 27:53.780
You just wait.

27:55.440 --> 27:55.970
Let's go.

28:02.200 --> 28:03.390
It seems

28:03.530 --> 28:05.030
they are coming back.

28:26.920 --> 28:27.640
See that?

28:29.030 --> 28:30.630
They are all here to kill you.

28:30.750 --> 28:32.120
I will listen to you, Young Master.

28:32.120 --> 28:34.050
I will listen to you, Young Master.

28:37.000 --> 28:38.310
In the 17th year of Jingning,

28:38.310 --> 28:39.550
Zhao Jichang was at his private residence,

28:39.550 --> 28:42.280
having a banquet with
grain merchant Song Wenhe.

28:45.400 --> 28:46.440
In the 25th year of Jingning,

28:46.440 --> 28:48.270
Madam Zhou, the wife of
grain merchant Song Wenhe,

28:48.270 --> 28:49.400
went to the capital to visit

28:49.400 --> 28:51.000
Madam Dong, the wife of Wang Xuanfan.

28:51.000 --> 28:52.730
They had a great conversation.

28:53.830 --> 28:55.350
It doesn't just involve Zhao Jichang,

28:55.350 --> 28:56.610
but also Wang Xuanfan.

28:56.720 --> 28:57.270
Exactly.

28:58.880 --> 29:00.030
To make a profit,

29:00.590 --> 29:02.960
the Song family
bribed many court officials.

29:02.960 --> 29:04.290
To protect themselves,

29:04.350 --> 29:05.640
they recorded all their transactions

29:05.640 --> 29:07.130
in an account book

29:07.640 --> 29:10.110
and gave it to an old accountant
for safekeeping.

29:10.110 --> 29:11.060
So I need you

29:11.480 --> 29:14.070
to go to Shanxi
immediately after the incident,

29:14.070 --> 29:15.440
and bring back both the old accountant

29:15.440 --> 29:16.640
and the account book.

29:16.790 --> 29:17.400
Then,

29:17.640 --> 29:19.570
the problem will be easily solved.

29:19.920 --> 29:20.960
But I can't help feeling

29:20.960 --> 29:23.890
that you're not just doing this
to help the Gu family.

29:25.310 --> 29:27.640
It also feels like
you're using me as a tool.

29:27.640 --> 29:29.040
If I remember correctly,

29:29.750 --> 29:31.810
Zhang Ling should have also received

29:32.070 --> 29:33.440
money from Song Wenhe.

29:34.440 --> 29:36.640
It must be recorded in the account book.

29:42.680 --> 29:43.350
Young Master.

29:43.350 --> 29:44.280
Don't come down.

29:44.400 --> 29:45.330
Leave this to me.

29:46.030 --> 29:46.750
Be careful.

30:38.680 --> 30:40.480
Young Master, we can move on now.

30:40.790 --> 30:41.320
Let's go.

30:41.590 --> 30:42.160
Yes.

30:46.440 --> 30:47.680
-Hyah.
-Hyah.

30:49.960 --> 30:50.510
Zhao.

30:51.590 --> 30:52.120
How is it?

30:52.240 --> 30:52.960
Any news?

30:53.160 --> 30:53.640
Yes.

30:54.270 --> 30:56.530
Young Master Ye has entered the capital.

30:57.000 --> 30:57.750
Great.

30:58.030 --> 30:58.960
This way, Third Master can

30:58.960 --> 31:00.110
get out of the Penal Court.

31:00.110 --> 31:00.840
Don't worry.

31:01.030 --> 31:01.440
I ordered someone

31:01.440 --> 31:02.750
to keep an eye on the Penal Court.

31:02.750 --> 31:03.640
Once Third Master comes out,

31:03.640 --> 31:05.300
we'll have news immediately.

31:09.030 --> 31:10.440
For such a huge case,

31:10.880 --> 31:12.960
I thought there would be a massive purge.

31:12.960 --> 31:14.270
I didn't expect you, Sir,

31:14.270 --> 31:15.720
to only punish these few people.

31:15.720 --> 31:16.440
Your Majesty.

31:16.440 --> 31:18.510
The new tax reform

31:18.680 --> 31:20.340
has reached a critical stage.

31:20.590 --> 31:22.590
If a massive purge is launched now,

31:23.270 --> 31:24.330
it will definitely

31:24.400 --> 31:25.720
cause public panic.

31:25.720 --> 31:27.720
This is detrimental to the country.

31:29.200 --> 31:30.260
You are right, Sir.

31:34.310 --> 31:35.110
Your Majesty.

31:35.110 --> 31:37.400
Commander Ye Xian
of the Penal Court requests an audience.

31:37.400 --> 31:38.220
He's back?

31:38.350 --> 31:40.150
Tell him to come in immediately.

31:41.350 --> 31:43.210
I pay my respects to Your Majesty.

31:44.920 --> 31:46.050
Greetings, Lord Fu.

31:47.790 --> 31:48.830
Commander Ye.

31:49.160 --> 31:50.550
Where have you been?

31:50.830 --> 31:52.160
By His Majesty's order,

31:52.440 --> 31:53.970
I went to Pingyang, Shanxi.

31:57.310 --> 31:58.400
Is that so?

32:01.510 --> 32:02.790
What's inside?

32:05.030 --> 32:05.830
Your Majesty.

32:06.310 --> 32:07.920
These are the account books

32:07.920 --> 32:09.440
confiscated from
grain merchant Song Wenhe's home.

32:09.440 --> 32:11.070
It contains all the records over the years

32:11.070 --> 32:13.310
of Song Wenhe bribing

32:13.440 --> 32:15.300
officials of the Imperial Court.

32:19.300 --> 32:22.330
[Wenyuan Pavilion]

32:20.400 --> 32:21.490
Tell me.

32:21.920 --> 32:23.680
We are only missing two people.

32:22.410 --> 32:26.390
[Virtue Equal to Heaven and Earth]

32:24.070 --> 32:25.310
How did it suddenly

32:25.310 --> 32:26.690
become so quiet?

32:27.440 --> 32:28.750
It's fine that

32:28.750 --> 32:30.150
old Fan Chuan isn't here.

32:30.960 --> 32:32.550
It's a pity about Jiuheng.

32:35.750 --> 32:37.280
Didn't Xuanweng say before

32:37.750 --> 32:38.920
Jiuheng would be back

32:38.920 --> 32:39.920
in a while?

32:42.640 --> 32:43.750
Yes.

32:43.710 --> 32:49.960
[Virtue Equal to Heaven and Earth]

32:46.200 --> 32:48.000
But even so,

32:48.960 --> 32:50.550
with the ups and downs of officialdom,

32:50.550 --> 32:52.160
who knows if it's for a while

32:53.270 --> 32:54.480
or for a lifetime?

32:56.070 --> 32:57.270
Prime Minister Wang.

32:58.680 --> 32:59.880
His Majesty summons you.

32:59.880 --> 33:00.350
Okay.

33:01.110 --> 33:01.720
Let's go.

33:07.030 --> 33:07.630
Xuanweng.

33:08.030 --> 33:08.440
No.

33:08.720 --> 33:09.320
Minister.

33:09.680 --> 33:11.110
I am wronged.

33:14.030 --> 33:15.270
It is written in this account book

33:15.270 --> 33:16.480
very clearly.

33:16.500 --> 33:18.530
Very clearly. Very clearly.

33:19.440 --> 33:22.030
On the Winter Solstice
of the 33rd year of Jingning,

33:22.030 --> 33:22.880
your wife,

33:23.920 --> 33:24.590
through

33:25.310 --> 33:28.000
the hands of
Zhao Jichang's wife, Madam Cai,

33:28.330 --> 33:30.370
received from Song Wenhe

33:30.390 --> 33:32.220
3,600 taels of silver,

33:34.310 --> 33:36.040
which was actually a dividend.

33:37.830 --> 33:39.360
What else do you have to say?

33:39.400 --> 33:39.860
I...

33:40.160 --> 33:40.920
What else do you have to say?

33:40.920 --> 33:41.440
I am innocent.

33:41.440 --> 33:41.830
I...

33:42.270 --> 33:43.270
I am innocent!

33:43.270 --> 33:44.130
I don't know...

33:49.930 --> 33:52.140
[Honor and Illumination]

33:50.030 --> 33:50.830
Your Majesty.

33:51.070 --> 33:51.920
Your Majesty.

33:52.590 --> 33:53.180
I...

33:53.240 --> 33:55.500
I am truly innocent!

33:55.590 --> 33:57.030
M-My wife

33:57.030 --> 33:58.490
is indeed quite sociable.

33:58.750 --> 33:59.680
Zhao Jichang's wife

33:59.680 --> 34:01.340
is the sister-in-law of Fan Chuan's wife.

34:01.340 --> 34:02.160
It is entirely possible that my wife

34:02.160 --> 34:04.190
associates with her.

34:04.270 --> 34:04.750
But...

34:05.160 --> 34:06.690
But as for taking the money,

34:07.440 --> 34:09.440
she absolutely wouldn't dare!

34:11.110 --> 34:11.670
Sir.

34:12.190 --> 34:13.480
I think Lord Wang

34:13.480 --> 34:14.610
truly doesn't know.

34:14.880 --> 34:16.550
Perhaps the accountant made it up

34:16.550 --> 34:17.750
and wronged his wife.

34:18.199 --> 34:19.710
Whether she is innocent or not,

34:19.710 --> 34:21.170
let's investigate first.

34:22.840 --> 34:23.570
That's true.

34:24.280 --> 34:25.150
However,

34:25.170 --> 34:27.429
Lord Wang is a Senior Minister after all.

34:27.760 --> 34:29.110
Although we must investigate,

34:29.110 --> 34:31.170
we shouldn't damage his reputation.

34:31.480 --> 34:32.280
Your Majesty.

34:34.230 --> 34:35.230
Lord Chen is

34:36.050 --> 34:38.050
still in the Penal Court's dungeon.

34:46.750 --> 34:47.420
Right.

34:49.250 --> 34:51.449
Sir, I'll leave it to you to decide.

34:57.870 --> 35:01.450
[Honor and Illumination]

35:04.400 --> 35:06.110
Commander Ye is right.

35:07.230 --> 35:09.290
Since Lord Wang is a Senior Minister,

35:09.400 --> 35:10.430
he should be

35:11.150 --> 35:12.840
an example to all officials.

35:13.760 --> 35:15.850
Please issue a decree, Your Majesty,

35:16.280 --> 35:17.400
to have Wang Xuanfan

35:17.400 --> 35:19.530
escorted to the Penal Court's dungeon

35:19.590 --> 35:22.390
and interrogated by
the Three Judiciary Offices.

35:31.030 --> 35:31.760
I

35:33.230 --> 35:35.230
receive the decree with gratitude.

35:50.150 --> 35:50.610
Mother.

35:56.070 --> 35:56.710
Mother.

35:57.920 --> 35:58.360
My son.

35:58.480 --> 35:59.030
Mother.

35:59.230 --> 36:00.590
-You've suffered.
-Jinxian.

36:00.590 --> 36:00.920
Jinxian.

36:00.920 --> 36:01.760
-Are you alright?
-I'm glad you're back.

36:01.760 --> 36:02.510
-Don't worry.
-It's good that you're back.

36:02.510 --> 36:03.070
I'm fine.

36:03.230 --> 36:04.890
-It's my fault.
-That's good.

36:05.110 --> 36:05.710
Let me look at you.

36:05.710 --> 36:06.840
I made you worry.

36:08.970 --> 36:10.480
It's good that you are fine.

36:10.480 --> 36:11.110
Now that you're home, that's enough.

36:11.110 --> 36:11.920
Mother.

36:12.840 --> 36:14.570
I was always worried about you.

36:17.040 --> 36:17.840
Honey.

36:18.190 --> 36:19.510
-Lian.
-Father.

36:19.510 --> 36:21.320
-Are you okay?
-This is ridiculous.

36:21.320 --> 36:23.050
Now it's my fault?

36:23.230 --> 36:24.630
We are all fine.

36:24.960 --> 36:25.710
Master.

36:25.710 --> 36:27.570
Now everything is clear.

36:28.190 --> 36:28.940
It's all right now.

36:28.940 --> 36:31.000
-That's good.
-Where is your sister?

36:31.400 --> 36:33.300
Zhao went to the shop.

36:33.960 --> 36:35.160
I was scared to death.

36:36.480 --> 36:37.280
-It's all over.
-Don't be sad.

36:37.280 --> 36:38.320
She is also a snob.

36:38.320 --> 36:39.360
I'm not sad.

36:39.360 --> 36:40.400
I'm back now.

36:40.400 --> 36:41.510
I'm just happy.

36:41.510 --> 36:42.590
Yes.

36:43.190 --> 36:43.870
You scared me to death.

36:43.300 --> 36:45.830
[Eternal Glory]

36:48.070 --> 36:49.590
Master was demoted to Pingyang

36:49.590 --> 36:51.190
to serve as a seventh-rank
county magistrate.

36:51.190 --> 36:53.450
He is ordered to leave after the New Year.

37:33.960 --> 37:35.540
Isn't this Yuanweng?

37:36.000 --> 37:37.400
How did you end up in here?

37:37.670 --> 37:39.730
It was just a moment of carelessness.

37:39.790 --> 37:41.320
In officialdom,
there are rises and falls.

37:41.320 --> 37:42.120
Life and death

37:42.710 --> 37:44.070
have always been part of the game.

37:44.070 --> 37:45.470
So that's what you think.

37:47.190 --> 37:49.620
No wonder you used
12,000 tons of bran

37:50.070 --> 37:52.270
to exchange for disaster relief grain.

37:54.280 --> 37:56.410
Such a cruel and inhumane practice...

38:01.590 --> 38:03.070
Only the truly reckless

38:03.440 --> 38:04.640
would dare to do this.

38:15.600 --> 38:16.730
Where is Zhang Ling?

38:16.960 --> 38:18.270
Why isn't he here to see me?

38:18.270 --> 38:18.970
My Lord.

38:19.110 --> 38:20.990
Lord Zhang colluded
with grain merchant Song Wenhe

38:20.990 --> 38:21.840
to embezzle funds.

38:21.840 --> 38:22.740
It was a heinous crime.

38:22.740 --> 38:23.770
His Majesty stripped him of

38:23.770 --> 38:25.700
his title as Commander on the spot.

38:25.920 --> 38:27.440
He was implicated too?

38:28.360 --> 38:29.760
Then the Commander of the Penal Court

38:29.760 --> 38:30.400
must be...

38:48.840 --> 38:51.000
Young Master Ye, you've been promoted.

38:51.000 --> 38:52.060
Congratulations.

38:53.510 --> 38:55.770
Zhang Ling might know about that matter.

39:01.970 --> 39:04.020
Heading out, Lord Chen?

39:04.170 --> 39:05.630
No wonder you look so smug.

39:06.030 --> 39:06.880
Careful, you might

39:06.880 --> 39:08.680
get locked up again in a few days.

39:46.590 --> 39:47.390
The file storeroom is a restricted area.

39:47.390 --> 39:49.850
We only recognize
the token, not the person.

39:50.730 --> 39:51.960
The token is verified.

39:51.960 --> 39:53.360
My Lord, this way please.

40:22.470 --> 40:25.870
[Chen Yanyun]

40:35.800 --> 40:36.320
Hyah!

40:38.230 --> 40:38.630
Hyah!

41:06.770 --> 41:09.250
♪ A good moment is strewn with starlight ♪

41:10.340 --> 41:13.540
♪ Flames burn away
the frost of bygone days ♪

41:14.850 --> 41:18.520
♪ Reflections tremble,
hearts beat in unison ♪

41:20.200 --> 41:23.050
♪ Candlelight weaves the web of fate ♪

41:24.500 --> 41:27.170
♪ Petal shadows
trace the lines of your face ♪

41:25.550 --> 41:26.630
Where is he?

41:28.360 --> 41:31.750
♪ Fleeting light
sketches the shape of fate ♪

41:30.190 --> 41:31.170
Did I arrive

41:31.480 --> 41:32.590
too early?

41:32.680 --> 41:36.310
♪ Footsteps fall lightly,
yet feelings can't be concealed ♪

41:37.270 --> 41:41.430
♪ In a backward glance,
a few hidden feelings slip through ♪

41:43.960 --> 41:46.140
♪ Ask the passing time
whether it has forgotten ♪

41:46.880 --> 41:48.360
♪ The moonlight of our first encounter ♪

41:49.600 --> 41:53.190
♪ Year after year,
it etches your likeness ♪

41:54.080 --> 41:56.310
♪ Count the faint shimmer
of the starry river ♪

41:57.590 --> 42:01.110
♪ Yet none compares
to the gentle light in your eyes ♪

42:02.070 --> 42:04.170
♪ At last, I see the galaxy
shimmering and swaying ♪

42:04.940 --> 42:06.750
♪ Reflected in our eyes ♪

42:07.680 --> 42:12.110
♪ I'll be with you forever ♪

42:13.460 --> 42:17.020
♪ And enjoy
the beautiful scenery with you ♪

42:18.890 --> 42:22.900
♪ For all the days of our lives,
our love will endure ♪

42:26.800 --> 42:27.860
Why are you crying?

42:30.590 --> 42:31.630
I don't know.

42:50.630 --> 42:51.440
Don't worry.

42:52.150 --> 42:52.770
I'm fine.

42:58.960 --> 42:59.690
Miss Qingpu.

43:01.070 --> 43:02.000
Why are you here?

43:02.360 --> 43:03.760
I've been here all along.

43:14.510 --> 43:15.740
Miss Qingpu.

43:15.770 --> 43:16.920
How about

43:17.030 --> 43:18.760
we go somewhere else for a walk?

43:21.230 --> 43:22.070
I'm not going.

43:26.150 --> 43:26.800
Okay.

43:31.280 --> 43:32.010
Let's go.

43:37.670 --> 43:38.920
I don't want to go.

44:12.600 --> 44:16.190
[A Splendid Match]
